    "title": "Theft by Unlawful Taking - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By News Desk ,\n21 hours ago On 8/15/2026 at approximately 1:39 AM, officers responded to the 200 block of S Main St for a report of several thefts of lawn chairs. The individual pictured stole several lawn chairs off of people’s front doorstep. If you or anybody you know has information regarding this incident, please contact the Chambersburg Police Department or submit a tip through Crimewatch. Read full article",
